es, and workforce types play a role in the city\u2019s success, creating complex but rewarding challenges for both newcomers and experienced city builders. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157220/extras/fe667d57a3a280327bc67cd2c8a73322.poster.avif?t=1771346776\" width=616 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157220/extras/fe667d57a3a280327bc67cd2c8a73322.webm?t=1771346776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157220/extras/fe667d57a3a280327bc67cd2c8a73322.mp4?t=1771346776\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Experience Mesopotamian History</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main campaign spans more than a dozen historical missions, covering key moments from the early colonization of Mesopotamia to the Persian conquest of Babylon in the 6th century BC. Each mission immerses you in a specific time period, presenting unique challenges that reflect the era\u2019s political, economic, and technological realities.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you choose to worship Inanna to receive more prestige from trade? Or perhaps support Enlil to more rapidly grow your populace? It\u2019s up to you how you engage with deities to expand trade as you manage resources in your growing city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157220/extras/caa97e63df954fe0a566278647a12589.poster.avif?t=1771346776\" width=616 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.aka